{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57202","headline":"十四科头 真俗不二 · 宝志","name":"十四科头 真俗不二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"法师说法极好，心中不离烦恼。\n口谈文字化他，转更增他生老。\n真妄本来不二，凡夫弃妄覔道。\n四衆云集听讲，高座论义浩浩。\n南座北座相争，四衆爲言爲好。\n虽然口谈甘露，心里寻常燥。\n自己元无一钱，日夜数他珍宝。\n恰似无智愚人，弃却真金担草。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宝志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_57202.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_57202","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}